  "status": "stable",
  "added": "2026-04-19",
  "notes": "Use for the title of works (articles, bookmarks, documents, events). schema:name is the broader schema.org equivalent for any Thing; for works prefer this term, for people/agents use `urn:solid:name`. For a news/article headline in schema.org-style data see `urn:solid:headline`; for short labels in UI use `rdfs:label`. Language-tagged values are allowed.",
